# Answer 2 · Forms of Gender-Based Violence and Workable Strategies to Eliminate It (CSS 2017)
@py question 2017-3

## The answer map
::: fig mindmap | The answer map: every branch is one numbered heading of the model answer below.
@note Classify the forms of GBV by nature — physical, sexual, psychological, economic and custom-based — with Pakistani examples, then propose strategies that are workable: realistic, affordable and built on existing laws and institutions.
@ask ① What are the DIFFERENT FORMS of GENDER-BASED VIOLENCE?
@ask ② In your OPINION, what could be WORKABLE STRATEGIES to ELIMINATE GBV from PAKISTANI society?
